% c416 (playability; Adler part 2 ch. 12, PDF 79: the timpani strengthen the tonic and dominant and consummate climactic cadence points; PDF 81, Ex. XII-51: mark tuning changes): the 30" drum is retuned G -> F in the rest at 95 (clos.ily),
